<FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif">
Morning Everyone,<P>Well, curiosity finally got the best of me, so I did a little research concerning 4 of the armor sets from Velious.  The ones that a few of seem to be concerned about are the Ry'gorr, Sentry, Guardian, and Sentient armor sets. <P>Full Suit of Ry'gorr Armor  -  AC+94, HP+30, STR+19, STA+6, DEX+2, AGI+3, CHA+5, INT+0, WIS+0, vs Magic+12, vs Cold+10, vs Fire+0, vs Poison+5, vs Disease+0, MANA+35<P>Full Suit of Sentry Armor - AC+116, HP+60, STR+2, STA+2, DEX+22, AGI+36, CHA+10, INT+9, WIS+4, vs Magic+25, vs Cold+4, vs Fire+8, vs Poison+32, vs Disease+32, MANA+105<P>Full Suit of Guardian Armor - AC+134, HP+91, STR+23, STA+34, DEX+17, AGI+4, CHA+10, INT+0, WIS+9, vs Magic+29, vs Cold+38, vs Fire+35, vs Poison+12, vs Disease+12, MANA+55<P>Full Suit of Sentient Armor (SK Only) - AC+100, HP+0, STR+0, STA+0, DEX+0, AGI+0, CHA+0, INT+41, WIS+0, vs Magic+16, vs Cold+0, vs Fire+0, vs Poison+0, vs Disease+0, MANA+10  <P>After looking at these numbers, other than the incredible +41 INT on the sentient armor, it pretty much sucks for a plate class char.  Only 100AC total, and pretty much NO other stats.  If I was a plate class I'd go for the Guardian peices that compliment your other gear, and try to find +INT jewelry in the case of Shadowknights.  The loss of AC and other stat bonuses is far greater than the loss of INT if you ask me.<P>I used a weighted scale for the +Stats I'm looking for for Kalaan, and got the following mix of armor that best suits him as a Rogue (In my opinion).  Sentry Boots, 1 Sentry Bracer, Sentry Leggings, Sentry Shoulders, Sentry Girdle, Ry'gorr Collar, Ry'gorr Arms, Ry'Gorr Gloves, Ry'gorr helm, Ry'gorr BP.  This setup gives me a total of:<P>Kalaans Mix - AC+120, HP+50, STR+17, STA+6, DEX+8, AGI+19, CHA+11, INT+2, WIS+2, vs Magic+25, vs Cold+9, vs Fire+0, vs Poison+20, vs Disease+15, MANA+75.<P>If anyone has any questions, feel free to post them.    <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  I'll try my best to answer.<P>**** Edit:  Added Crafted,Lambent,Darkforge, and Ravenscale armor sets ****<P>Full Suit of Crafted Armor - AC+118, HP+25, STR+9, STA+5, DEX+4, AGI+5, CHA+5, INT+4, WIS+5, sv Magic+4, sv Cold+2, sv Fire+2, sv Poison+2, sv Disease+2, MANA+0<P>Full Suit of Darkforge Armor - AC+98, HP+0, STR+4, STA+22, DEX+8, AGI+0, CHA+0, INT+5, WIS+0, sv Magic+16, sv Cold+5, sv Fire+5, sv Poison+5, sv Disease+5, MANA+0<P>Full Suit of Lambent Armor - AC+98, HP+25, STR+8, STA+5, DEX+10, AGI+0, CHA+10, INT+5, WIS+0, sv Magic+4, sv Cold+4, sv Fire+4, sv Poison+4, sv Disease+4, MANA+0<P>Full Suit of Ravenscale Armor - AC+92, HP+15, STR+6, STA+5, DEX+8, AGI+, CHA+7, INT+5, WIS+1, sv Magic+8, sv Cold+0, sv Fire+5, sv Poison+13, sv Disease+12, MANA+0<p>[ August 01, 2001: Message edited by: Lownar/Kalaan/Sendil ]<P>--------------------<P>Lownar Baardeth - 55th Level Gnecromancer<BR>Kalaan - 30th Level Rogue<BR>Rakasak - 19th Level Monk<BR>Bertox. Server
